    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check Out Something Scarier</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Altidudes is an infinite climber about dudes skateboarding up the tallest mountain in the world, while trying to avoid obstacles and get the highest score!<br><br>FEATURES<br>- A combination of infinite runners and platformers but still not quite able to fit into one genre.<br>- Beautiful art created pixel by pixel and inspired by your favorite arcade games of yesteryear<br>- Tubular 8-bit tunes by Bert Cole that will keep you coming back for more!<br>- Jump, dodge, and slide your way up an impossibly tall mountain<br>- Unlock and choose from a variety of dudes to play as!<br>- Beat your high score again and again!<br>- Play one-handed!<br><br><br>Thanks for checking it out dudes and dudettes!",
    "about_the_game": "Altidudes is an infinite climber about dudes skateboarding up the tallest mountain in the world, while trying to avoid obstacles and get the highest score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES<br />\r\n- A combination of infinite runners and platformers but still not quite able to fit into one genre.<br />\r\n- Beautiful art created pixel by pixel and inspired by your favorite arcade games of yesteryear<br />\r\n- Tubular 8-bit tunes by Bert Cole that will keep you coming back for more!<br />\r\n- Jump, dodge, and slide your way up an impossibly tall mountain<br />\r\n- Unlock and choose from a variety of dudes to play as!<br />\r\n- Beat your high score again and again!<br />\r\n- Play one-handed!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThanks for checking it out dudes and dudettes!",
    "short_description": "Get your skateboard ready, you are about to climb the tallest mountain in the whole world! With a seemingly infinite height, you can climb as high as you want, but will you ever reach the top?? Pixel graphics! Dude references! Skateboards! A big mountain! We got it all!",
